msgstr "Établissement d’une connexion sécurisée"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:19
msgid "Pairing your site with WP Umbrella"
msgstr "Appairage de votre site avec WP Umbrella"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:20
msgid "Generating your encryption keys"
msgstr "Génération de vos clés de chiffrement"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:21
msgid "Signing and sealing the connection"
msgstr "Signature et scellement de la connexion"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:22
msgid "Finalizing your setup"
msgstr "Finalisation de votre configuration"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:23
msgid "Your site is connected"
msgstr "Votre site est connecté"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:24
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:299
msgid "Select a workspace"
msgstr "Sélectionnez un espace de travail"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:26
msgid "You are not authorized to perform this action."
msgstr "Vous n’êtes pas autorisé à effectuer cette action."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:27
msgid ""
"On a WordPress network, only a network administrator can connect a site to "
"WP Umbrella. Ask yours to enter the API key for this site."
msgstr ""
"Sur un réseau WordPress, seul un administrateur du réseau peut connecter un "
"site à WP Umbrella. Demandez au vôtre de saisir la clé API pour ce site."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:28
msgid "The API key is invalid."
msgstr "La clé API est invalide."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:29
msgid "Bad API Key"
msgstr "Clé API incorrecte"

#. translators: %1$s is an opening link tag to the support mailbox, %2$s is the closing link tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:33
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The API key seems to be invalid. Please check it and try again. If the "
"problem persists, %1$splease contact our support.%2$s"
msgstr ""
"La clé API semble invalide. Vérifiez-la et réessayez. Si le problème "
"persiste, %1$scontactez notre support.%2$s"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:39
msgid "Limit excedeed"
msgstr "Limite atteinte"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:40
msgid ""
"You have reached the maximum number of sites allowed by your plan. (5 sites "
"for the free plan)"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez atteint le nombre maximum de sites autorisé par votre offre. (5 "
"sites pour l’offre gratuite)"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:41
msgid ""
"You have reached the maximum number of sites allowed by your plan. (5 sites "
"during the trial)"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez atteint le nombre maximum de sites autorisé par votre offre. (5 "
"sites pendant la période d’essai)"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:42
msgid "No answer from WP Umbrella"
msgstr "Aucune réponse de WP Umbrella"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:43
msgid ""
"Your site could not get an answer from WP Umbrella in time. Your settings "
"have been kept, so simply try again in a moment. If it keeps happening, "
"contact our support."
msgstr ""
"Votre site n’a pas reçu de réponse de WP Umbrella à temps. Vos réglages ont "
"été conservés, réessayez simplement dans un instant. Si cela se reproduit, "
"contactez notre support."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:44
msgid "HTTP Auth credentials needed"
msgstr "Identifiants HTTP Auth requis"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:45
msgid ""
"Your site is protected by HTTP Basic Authentication. Please fill in the HTTP "
"Auth User and Password fields above."
msgstr ""
"Votre site est protégé par une authentification HTTP Basic. Renseignez les "
"champs Utilisateur HTTP Auth et Mot de passe HTTP Auth ci-dessus."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:46
msgid "HTTP Auth credentials invalid"
msgstr "Identifiants HTTP Auth invalides"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:47
msgid ""
"The HTTP Auth User and Password you entered were rejected by your site. "
"Please check them and try again."
msgstr ""
"L’utilisateur et le mot de passe HTTP Auth que vous avez saisis ont été "
"rejetés par votre site. Vérifiez-les et réessayez."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:48
msgid "Unknown PHP error"
msgstr "Erreur PHP inconnue"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:49
msgid "WordPress critical error detected"
msgstr "Erreur critique WordPress détectée"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:50
msgid ""
"Your WordPress site is currently throwing a PHP fatal error, which prevents "
"WP Umbrella from connecting. This is not an issue with WP Umbrella itself: "
"any plugin or external tool calling your site's REST API would fail the same "
"way."
msgstr ""
"Votre site WordPress génère actuellement une erreur fatale PHP, ce qui "
"empêche WP Umbrella de s’y connecter. Le problème ne vient pas de WP "
"Umbrella : n’importe quelle extension ou n’importe quel outil externe "
"appelant la REST API de votre site échouerait de la même manière."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:51
msgid "Error reported by your site:"
msgstr "Erreur signalée par votre site :"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:52
msgid "How to resolve it:"
msgstr "Comment la résoudre :"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:53
msgid ""
"Open your hosting control panel (cPanel, Plesk, etc.) or connect via FTP/"
"SFTP."
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez le panneau de contrôle de votre hébergement (cPanel, Plesk, etc.) ou "
"connectez-vous en FTP/SFTP."

#. translators: %1$s is an opening HTML tag, %2$s is the matching closing tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:57
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Navigate to the file shown above and either fix it or rename it (for "
"example, append %1$s.disabled%2$s to the filename) to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Rendez-vous sur le fichier indiqué ci-dessus et corrigez-le, ou renommez-le "
"pour le désactiver (par exemple en ajoutant %1$s.disabled%2$s à la fin du "
"nom de fichier)."

#. translators: %1$s is an opening HTML tag, %2$s is the matching closing tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:66
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Reload your WordPress admin to confirm the error is gone, then click "
"%1$sValidate%2$s again here."
msgstr ""
"Rechargez l’administration de votre site WordPress pour vérifier que "
"l’erreur a disparu, puis cliquez à nouveau sur %1$sValider%2$s ici."

#. translators: %1$s is an opening link tag to the support mailbox, %2$s is the closing link tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:75
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you do not have access to your site's files, please forward this message "
"to your hosting provider or developer. If you need help, our team is "
"available at %1$ssupport@wp-umbrella.com%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Si vous n’avez pas accès aux fichiers de votre site, transmettez ce message "
"à votre hébergeur ou à votre développeur. Si vous avez besoin d’aide, notre "
"équipe est disponible à l’adresse %1$ssupport@wp-umbrella.com%2$s."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:81
msgid "Connection Issue: Action Required"
msgstr "Problème de connexion : action requise"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:82
msgid ""
"We're currently unable to connect to your site. This is often due to the "
"site's hosting firewall or security plugin mistakenly blocking WP Umbrella."
msgstr ""
"Nous ne parvenons pas à nous connecter à votre site pour le moment. Cela "
"vient souvent du pare-feu de votre hébergement ou d’une extension de "
"sécurité qui bloque WP Umbrella par erreur."

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:83
msgid "To Resolve This:"
msgstr "Pour résoudre ce problème :"

#. translators: %1$s is an opening HTML tag, %2$s is the matching closing tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:87
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s1. Whitelist Our Server IPs:%2$s Please ensure the following IPs are "
"allowed access by your hosting provider or security settings:"
msgstr ""
"%1$s1. Autorisez les IP de nos serveurs :%2$s assurez-vous que les IP "
"suivantes sont autorisées par votre hébergeur ou par vos réglages de "
"sécurité :"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:93
msgid "IPv4:"
msgstr "IPv4 :"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:94
msgid "IPv6:"
msgstr "IPv6 :"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:95
msgid "Copy all IPs v4"
msgstr "Copier toutes les IP v4"

#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:96
msgid "Copy this IP"
msgstr "Copier cette IP"

#. translators: %1$s is an opening HTML tag, %2$s is the matching closing tag.
#: templates/admin/components/forms/validate-api-key.php:100
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s2. Check WordPress REST API Access%2$s: Confirm that access to the "
"WordPress REST API is not being restricted, as this is crucial for "
"communication with WP Umbrella."
msgstr ""
"%1$s2. Vérifiez l’accès à la REST API WordPress%2$s : confirmez que l’accès "
